    intro: ["A renovation touches every trade in the building at once. We sequence strip-out, structure, first fix, plastering, second fix and finishes so the house comes back together in the right order, and we manage Building Control, the structural engineer and specialist subcontractors as part of the job.", "Most of our renovation work is Victorian, Edwardian and 1930s housing in Altrincham, Hale and Bowdon, often combined with a rear extension or a loft or basement conversion in the same contract."],
